      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "您的意思是要在后半程，瞄准红组出击的时机对吧！？\n当她们挺过了速子小姐的猛攻，为了决胜负而来到前线时——",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f2a4ae291799601f613e91fdaf89d9a1f994402d8cddd5da6b2c13cef287045",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
